<title>USA: Computerized Thermal names president.</title>
<headline>Computerized Thermal names president.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computerized Thermal Imaging, Inc said Thursday it named David Packer president, effective June 1.</p>
<p>Formerly, Packer was the manager of Engineering Office of TRW Inc in Ogden, Utah.</p>
<p>R.V. Secord, former president of CTI, will assume the role of vice chairman while retaining the title of chief operating officer.</p>
